  "_promos_note": "Editorial overrides for introductory/promotional pricing. Keyed by OpenRouter id. A promo expiry looks identical to a price hike from a single daily snapshot, so the list_* price must be recorded BEFORE the promo ends. Hand-maintained: there is no feed for this.",
